					"id": 750870901,
					"content": "Why are there Saurus Crackers here? This letter...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870902,
					"content": "So Quilla was the mastermind, just like Paimon thought! Even if it was for an unexpected reason... Ugh, Paran's got rotten luck for sure.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870903,
					"content": "Just thinking about how Taruka and Oberon might be imprisoned in the camp in front of us makes Paimon feel bad about doing nothing... They didn't do anything wrong.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870904,
					"content": "#Hmm... {NICKNAME}, let's think of a way to save them, shall we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750870905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750870905,
					"content": "If we can <color=#00E1FFFF>hide amidst the Iktomisaurus patrol squad</color>, maybe we'll have an easier time getting in!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
